-- the four cases exhaust the thirty: eight, twelve, one and nine. The diagnostic is decidable from the
-- record, so this is a procedure a knowledge graph can run over its own holdings rather than a judgement
-- someone has to make per compound -- and the number that matters for a record's trustworthiness is the
-- twelve plus the nine, which is twenty-one, the compounds whose stored count is wrong.
diagnosis-partitions : plus (plus (count-of-kind 0 compds) (count-of-kind 1 compds)) (plus (count-of-kind 2 compds) (count-of-kind 3 compds)) ≡ 30
diagnosis-partitions = λ i → 30
